, 0.929, 0.962], "content": "2"}]}, {"page_idx": 2, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.094, 0.466, 0.123], "content": "If\t  you\t  note\t  any\t  errors\t  in\t  this\t  document,\t  please\t  let\t  us\t  know\t  by emailing\t  <u>askdnd@wizards.com</u>."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.092, 0.135, 0.204, 0.164], "level": 2, "content": "Races"}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.09, 0.169, 0.221, 0.188], "level": 2, "content": "Racial Traits"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.196, 0.443, 0.257], "content": "The\t  description\t  of\t  each\t  race\t  includes\t  racial\t  traits that\t  are\t  common\t  to\t  members\t  of\t  that\t  race.\t  The following\t  entries\t  appear\t  among\t  the\t  traits\t  of\t  most races."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.091, 0.267, 0.285, 0.284], "level": 2, "content": "Ability Score Increase"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.285, 0.44, 0.315], "content": "Every\t  race\t  increases\t  one\t  or\t  more\t  of\t  a\t  character’s ability\t  scores."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.09, 0.327, 0.132, 0.344], "level": 2, "content": "Age"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.344, 0.465, 0.509], "content": "The\t  age\t  entry\t  notes\t  the\t  age\t  when\t  a\t  member\t  of the race\t  is\t  considered\t  an\t  adult,\t  as\t  well\t  as\t  the\t  race’s expected\t  lifespan.\t  This\t  information\t  can\t  help\t  you decide\t  how\t  old\t  your\t  character\t  is\t  at\t  the\t  start\t  of\t  the game.\t  You\t  can\t  choose\t  any\t  age\t  for\t  your\t  character, which\t  could\t  provide\t  an\t  explanation\t  for\t  some\t  of\t  your ability\t  scores.\t  For\t  example,\t  if\t  you\t  play\t  a\t  young\t  or very\t  old\t  character,\t  your\t  age\t  could\t  explain\t  a particularly\t  low\t  Strength\t  or\t  Constitution\t  score, while\t  advanced\t  age\t  could\t  account\t  for\t  a\t  high Intelligence\t  or\t  Wisdom."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.091, 0.519, 0.187, 0.535], "level": 2, "content": "Alignment"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.536, 0.461, 0.626], "content": "Most\t  races\t  have\t  tendencies\t  toward\t  certain alignments,\t  described\t  in\t  this\t  entry.\t  These\t  are\t  not binding\t  for\t  player\t  characters,\t  but\t  considering\t  why your\t  dwarf\t  is\t  chaotic,\t  for\t  example,\t  in\t  defiance\t  of lawful\t  dwarf\t  society\t  can\t  help\t  you\t  better\t  define\t  your character."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.09, 0.637, 0.132, 0.652], "level": 2, "content": "Size"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.655, 0.465, 0.76], "content": "Characters\t  of\t  most\t  races\t  are\t  Medium,\t  a\t  size\t  category including\t  creatures\t  that\t  are\t  roughly\t  4\t  to\t  8\t  feet\t  tall. Members\t  of\t  a\t  few\t  races\t  are\t  Small\t  (between\t  2\t  and\t  4 feet\t  tall),\t  which\t  means\t  that\t  certain\t  rules\t  of\t  the\t  game affect\t  them\t  differently.\t  The\t  most\t  important\t  of\t  these rules\t  is\t  that\t  Small\t  characters\t  have\t  trouble\t  wielding heavy\t  weapons,\t  as\t  explained\t  in\t  “Equipment.”"}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.09, 0.77, 0.15, 0.787], "level": 2, "content": "Speed"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.787, 0.457, 0.82], "content": "Your\t  speed\t  determines\t  how\t  far\t  you\t  can\t  move\t  when traveling\t  (\t  “Adventuring”)\t  and\t  fighting\t  (“Combat”)."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.091, 0.83, 0.185, 0.847], "level": 2, "content": "Languages"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.847, 0.433, 0.878], "content": "By\t  virtue\t  of\t  your\t  race,\t  your\t  character\t  can\t  speak, read,\t  and\t  write\t  certain\t  languages."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.533, 0.092, 0.617, 0.108], "level": 2, "content": "Subraces"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.531, 0.11, 0.899, 0.185], "content": "Some\t  races\t  have\t  subraces.\t  Members\t  of\t  a\t  subrace have\t  the\t  traits\t  of\t  the\t  parent\t  race\t  in\t  addition\t  to\t  the traits\t  specified\t  for\t  their\t  subrace.\t  Relationships among\t  subraces\t  vary\t  significantly\t  from\t  race\t  to\t  race and\t  world\t  to\t  world."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.533, 0.201, 0.668, 0.245], "level": 2, "content": "Dwarf Dwarf Traits"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.532, 0.253, 0.888, 0.284], "content": "Your\t  dwarf\t  character\t  has\t  an\t  assortment\t  of\t  inborn abilities,\t  part\t  and\t  parcel\t  of\t  dwarven\t  nature."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.532, 0.284, 0.886, 0.313], "content": "**Ability\t  Score\t  Increase.** Your\t  Constitution\t  score increases\t  by\t  2."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.532, 0.313, 0.902, 0.358], "content": "**Age.**\t  Dwarves\t  mature\t  at\t  the\t  same\t  rate\t  as\t  humans, but\t  they’re\t  considered\t  young\t  until\t  they\t  reach\t  the age\t  of\t  50.\t  On\t  average,\t  they\t  live\t  about\t  350\t  years."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.532, 0.358, 0.904, 0.431], "content": "**Alignment.**\t  Most\t  dwarves\t  are\t  lawful,\t  believing firmly\t  in\t  the\t  benefits\t  of\t  a\t  well-­‐‑ordered\t  society.\t  They tend\t  toward\t  good\t  as\t  well,\t  with\t  a\t  strong\t  sense\t  of\t  fair play\t  and\t  a\t  belief\t  that\t  everyone\t  deserves\t  to\t  share\t  in the\t  benefits\t  of\t  a\t  just\t  order."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.534, 0.431, 0.899, 0.461], "content": "**Size.** Dwarves\t  stand\t  between\t  4\t  and\t  5\t  feet\t  tall\t  and average\t  about\t  150\t  pounds.\t  Your\t  size\t  is\t  Medium."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.534, 0.461, 0.888, 0.491], "content": "**Speed.** Your\t  base\t  walking\t  speed\t  is\t  25\t  feet.\t  Your speed\t  is\t  not\t  reduced\t  by\t  wearing\t  heavy\t  armor."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.532, 0.491, 0.906, 0.58], "content": "**Darkvision.** Accustomed\t  to\t 