962], "content": "3"}]}, {"page_idx": 3, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "bbox": [0.09, 0.092, 0.187, 0.108], "content": "**Hill Dwarf**"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.11, 0.462, 0.139], "content": "As\t  a\t  hill\t  dwarf,\t  you\t  have\t  keen\t  senses,\t  deep\t  intuition, and\t  remarkable\t  resilience."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.09, 0.139, 0.415, 0.168], "content": "**Ability\t  Score\t  Increase.**\t  Your\t  Wisdom\t  score increases\t  by\t  1."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.169, 0.454, 0.215], "content": "**Dwarven\t  Toughness.** Your\t  hit\t  point\t  maximum increases\t  by\t  1,\t  and\t  it\t  increases\t  by\t  1\t  every\t  time\t  you gain\t  a\t  level."}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.091, 0.245, 0.187, 0.29], "level": 2, "content": "Elf Elf Traits"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.298, 0.459, 0.327], "content": "Your\t  elf\t  character\t  has\t  a\t  variety\t  of\t  natural\t  abilities, the\t  result\t  of\t  thousands\t  of\t  years\t  of\t  elven\t  refinement."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.091, 0.328, 0.425, 0.357], "content": "**Ability\t  Score\t  Increase.**\t  Your\t  Dexterity\t  score increases\t  by 2."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.357, 0.448, 0.46], "content": "**Age.** Although\t  elves\t  reach\t  physical\t  maturity\t  at about\t  the\t  same\t  age\t  as\t  humans,\t  the\t  elven understanding\t  of\t  adulthood\t  goes\t  beyond\t  physical growth\t  to\t  encompass\t  worldly\t  experience.\t  An\t  elf typically\t  claims\t  adulthood\t  and\t  an\t  adult\t  name around\t  the\t  age\t  of\t  100\t  and\t  can\t  live\t  to\t  be\t  750\t  years old."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.09, 0.461, 0.458, 0.535], "content": "**Alignment.** Elves\t  love\t  freedom,\t  variety,\t  and\t  self-­‐‑ expression,\t  so\t  they\t  lean\t  strongly\t  toward\t  the\t  gentler aspects\t  of\t  chaos.\t  They\t  value\t  and\t  protect\t  others’ freedom\t  as\t  well\t  as\t  their\t  own,\t  and\