ened.\t  Some\t  illusions\t  create\t  phantom"}, {"type": "footer", "bbox": [0.62, 0.948, 0.864, 0.963], "content": "System\t  Reference\t  Document\t  5.1"}, {"type": "page_number", "bbox": [0.917, 0.947, 0.948, 0.962], "content": "103"}]}, {"page_idx": 103, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "bbox": [0.089, 0.092, 0.439, 0.119], "continues_prev": true, "content": "images\t  that\t  any\t  creature\t  can\t  see,\t  but\t  the\t  most\t  insidious illusions\t  plant\t  an\t  image\t  directly\t  in\t  the\t  mind\t  of\t  a\t  creature."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.09, 0.12, 0.439, 0.175], "content": "**Necromancy** spells\t  manipulate\t  the\t  energies\t  of\t  life\t  and death.\t  Such\t  spells\t  can\t  grant\t  an\t  extra\t  reserve\t  of\t  life\t  force, drain\t  the\t  life\t  energy\t  from\t  another\t  creature,\t  create\t  the undead,\t  or\t  even\t  bring\t  the\t  dead\t  back\t  to\t  life."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.09, 0.175, 0.462, 0.215], "content": "Creating\t  the\t  undead\t  through\t  the\t  use\t  of\t  necromancy\t  spells such\t  as\t  animate\t  dead is\t  not\t  a\t  good\t  act,\t  and\t  only\t  evil\t  casters use\t  such\t  spells\t  frequently."}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.09, 0.217, 0.466, 0.286], "content": "**Transmutation** spells\t  change\t  the\t  properties\t  of\t  a\t  creature, object,\t  or\t  environment.\t  They\t  might\t  turn\t  an\t  enemy\t  into\t  a harmless\t  creature,\t  bolster\t  the\t  strength\t  of\t  an\t  ally,\t  make\t  an object\t  move\t  at\t  the\t  caster’s\t  command,\t  or\t  enhance\t  a\t  creature’s <u>innate\t  healing\t  abilities\t  to\t  rapidly\t  recover\t  from\t  injury.</u>"}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "bbox": [0.091, 0.294, 0.358, 0.313], "level": 2, "content": "Combining Magical Effects"}, {"type": "text", "bbox": [0.09, 0.32, 0.458, 0.41], "content": "The\t  effects\t  of\t  different\t  spells\t  add\t  together\t  while\t  the durations\t  of\t  those\t  spells\t  